he southern C-44/C-45 share an ordinary lot edge. Keep the original unsuffixed source wording."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Original 2017","cell":"G146","originalText":"Passage 44-45","interpretationNote":"Historical location reference; confirm individual gravesite and deed assignments separately."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Original 2017","cell":"G151","originalText":"Passage 107-112","interpretationNote":"Fits this corridor\u2019s opposing lot rows. Final gravesite assignments and corridor limits still require review."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Original 2017","cell":"G163","originalText":"Passage 70A-71A","interpretationNote":"2017 preserves suffixes that are dropped in 2022 (70-71). Map location is the northern corridor between current C-70A/C-71A."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Original 2017","cell":"G164","originalText":"Passage 74-75","interpretationNote":"Both older unsuffixed references and a 2022 loss of the A suffix occur. Candidate location is the northern corridor between current C-74A/C-75A; retain separate source/owner records."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Original 2017","cell":"G169","originalText":"Passage 74A-75A","interpretationNote":"Original 2017 G169 uses A suffixes; Updated 2022 F176 drops them. Candidate location is the northern corridor between C-74A/C-75A."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Original 2017","cell":"G185","originalText":"Passage  60-61","interpretationNote":"Historical location reference; confirm individual gravesite and deed assignments separately."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Original 2017","cell":"G243","originalText":"Passage 108-113","interpretationNote":"Fits this corridor\u2019s opposing lot rows. Final gravesite assignments and corridor limits still require review."},{"source":"Trinity Cemet