":"F17","originalText":"Passage between 17-72","interpretationNote":"Map interpretation uses current C-72A, not the southern C-72."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Updated 2022","cell":"F50","originalText":"8' Passage between 98-103","interpretationNote":"Fits this corridor\u2019s opposing lot rows. Final gravesite assignments and corridor limits still require review."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Updated 2022","cell":"F63","originalText":"Passage 16-63","interpretationNote":"Fits this corridor\u2019s opposing lot rows. Final gravesite assignments and corridor limits still require review."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Updated 2022","cell":"F78","originalText":"Passage 99-104","interpretationNote":"Fits this corridor\u2019s opposing lot rows. Final gravesite assignments and corridor limits still require review."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Updated 2022","cell":"F85","originalText":"Passage 97-102","interpretationNote":"Updated 2022 F216 and H216 correct the 2017 79-102 wording. Original 2017 G82 already uses 97-102 for the prior owner. These are source/transfer history, not additional land."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Updated 2022","cell":"F92","originalText":"Passage 13-43","interpretationNote":"Map interpretation uses current C-43A, not the southern C-43."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Updated 2022","cell":"F94","originalText":"Passage 15-62","interpretationNote":"Fits this corridor\u2019s opposing lot rows. Final gravesite assignments and corridor limits still require review."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Updated 2022","cell":"F105","originalText":"Passage 11-42","interpretationNote":"Map interpretation uses current C-42A, not the southern C-42."},{"source":"Trinity Cemetery Registry 2022.xlsx","worksheet":"Updated 2022","cell":"F114","or